From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 21:39:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] macaudio: Add the J604 speakers

The MacBook Pro 14" M4 (J604) speaker card, "MacBook Pro J604", is the
J616s one: six SN012776 amps (four woofers, two tweeters) on the AOP's
speaker stream, no headphone codec on the card (the jack is a card of
its own, "MacBook Pro J604 Jack"), and macaudio's J616s configuration
with its controls. So the J604 uses the J616 file and its
laptops/HiFi-speakers.conf: Speaker Playback Mux on Secondary, Speaker
Switch on, six channels on hw:${CardId},1.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
---
 ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Pro J604.conf | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Pro J604.conf

diff --git a/ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Pro J604.conf b/ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Pro J604.conf
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f49aad7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ucm2/conf.d/macaudio/MacBook Pro J604.conf	
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+Syntax 6
+
+SectionUseCase."HiFi" {
+	Comment "Default"
+	File "/conf.d/macaudio/laptops/HiFi-speakers.conf"
+}
-- 
2.56.0

